[gd_scene format=3]

; Draws each kind of mesh through MeshInstance2D, the one node that puts a mesh on the canvas: QuadMesh, BoxMesh
; and PlaneMesh, an ArrayMesh with 3D vertices and with 2D vertices (ARRAY_FLAG_USE_2D_VERTICES), with and
; without vertex colours, textured and not, and a QuadMesh turned and mirrored. No other scene
; has a MeshInstance2D, so none shows a regression in how the canvas reads a mesh.

